    "Primary 001C response association adjusts arm. The baseline sensitivity additionally includes own baseline score and baseline total Mayo; the barcode sensitivity includes four inferred barcode differences.",
    "001C2 common model includes intercept, arm, response, own baseline score and inflammation-score delta, with 65 rows and rank 5. It intentionally omits baseline Mayo for the cross-cohort common specification while preserving the Mayo-adjusted 001C model.",
    "Changing to the common specification after observing 001C is correctly labelled exploratory. Freeze this specification before reading GSE23597 expression; no model may be chosen retrospectively from external validation significance.",
    "Adding contemporaneous inflammation or epithelial-marker change estimates a conditional association, not causal mediation or biological independence. The epithelial4 marker mean is not a calibrated cell proportion.",
    "In models that include own baseline score, delta regression is equivalent to an ANCOVA contrast on follow-up with baseline adjustment. Coefficients should be presented as baseline-adjusted associations, not evidence that the omitted or included baseline model is biologically true.",
    "Source-defined clinical response is post-treatment; these regressions and logistic LRTs describe contemporaneous association, not prospective prediction or a treatment-effect mechanism."
